{
 "desc": "Brothers mode, the full run's segment 2 from its checkpoint (Frankly's house, its door both ways, his lesson in gor_02): through a scene Luigi stands in his own place, not in the partner or an NPC or right behind them; after Frankly's door he is inside with Mario. Before, he stood in Goombella for the whole lesson and stayed outside Frankly's closed door",
